# Edgard, the hero (#343, D79): hand-drawn 64x64 frames, exported by tools/hero_sprites.py.
# Registration: feet on row 63, body centre on x 31.5 (the 11x22 hitbox spans x 26..36, y 42..63).
# Drawn at (position.x - 8, position.y - 16) from the 48x48 Entity box; world Y grows down.
# The sword is always in Edgard's RIGHT hand: in front of the body facing right (r.*), behind it facing left (l.*).
# Standing and running poses stay within rows 33..63 (31 px: the lowest ceiling the hero passes is 32 px).
# `_` keeps the pixel underneath, `.` clears it (see tools/hero_sprites.py).
